PhaseCont pc-engine

src/cycle/mesh.rs is ported from AUTO-07p src/mesh.f90 (EQDF with IPER true and false,
NEWMSH and INTERP),
https://github.com/auto-07p/auto-07p at commit cb5dd4616be3fabd3ace9fb9f9b22fcbac9fc447.
src/cycle/hom.rs ports test functions 1 to 12 of PSIHO, the sign rule of EIGHO and the
basis rotation of PRJCTN from AUTO-07p src/homcont.f90 at commit
44cc1c42a888179bdbd608a40613caee9cbc4675.
